  "record": {
    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "The FF7 scaffold is now a real shared editor for both installed Steam products. It decodes 416 named records across Items, Weapons, Armor, Accessories, and Materia; uses bounded shared Detail controls with live Vanilla references; and writes an atomically verified project KERNEL.BIN while preserving unknown bytes. Binary tests passed on both product paths, and the hidden Edge edit/save/readback render passed without console errors. Characters, enemies, encounters, shops, tweaks, and text writes remain disabled because their writable paths are not yet proved. No project output has been deployed into either game, so launched-game behavior is still unverified.",
